332 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Department of Aerospace Engineering extends a warm welcome to all of you. Thank you for choosing Aerospace Engineering at IIT Bombay as your choice. Aerospace engineering is indeed a multi-disciplinary department offering exciting opportunities for learning. The department offers a carefully curated curriculum developed keeping in mind the needs of the aerospace industry and research labs of the country.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
333 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The curriculum offers  the right mix of core and elective courses to enable you to gain a strong foundation in aerospace engineering as well as develop breadth in your respective specialisation. You will have opportunities to carry out exploratory projects or supervised learning projects, more detailed projects in the form of BTech project stages 1 and 2. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
334 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (These projects could enable you to apply the theory taught in these courses to actual use. These also gives you a perspective for carrying out research in cutting-edge areas in various specialisations of the department.)
/Pg 9 0 R
>>
endobj
335 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Being in a batch of students from diverse backgrounds and from across the country gives you good networking opportunities. We strongly encourage you to make the best use of this. Besides academics, there are several activities at the department as well as Institute level where you can contribute and use your skillsets. A judicious mix of academics and co-curricular activities is essential in overall personality development. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
endobj
336 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We wish you all the best, and we are hopeful that you will make the most of  your stay at the institute!)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
