<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Before we deep dive into the details of all the projects, a question generally arises as to what purpose or perks do these projects provide, why should someone even spend their time into one if they are already occupied with their curriculum/extracurriculars in the institute. But it turns out that whatever career path one follows, projects become an utmost necessity or add up a lot of importance in research or even the industry/corporate world, since they add up to your hands-on skillset and provide a practical experience of all the theory which we study through our courses. It is one of the most standing out factor reflecting in your C.V/resume. Moreover availing the research related Letter of Recommendation from the professor/guide also adds another benefit for internships/higher studies)
/Alt ()
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [2]
