/T (Aerospace engineering graduates from IIT Bombay commonly pursue higher studies at top global institutions renowned for their programs and research. For master's degrees, popular destinations include leading US universities such as Caltech \(which offers combined PhD and master's tracks\), MIT, Stanford, Georgia Tech, and the University of Michigan, as well as ETH Zurich, where master's admission is accessible but PhD spots are highly competitive. Those interested in professorial careers often target US PhD programs, while students aspiring to become engineers or research scientists in industry favor EU PhDs due to their industry-oriented focus. )
