949 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (This event, typically held at the start of the semester, serves to introduce freshers to key aspects of the department. The Head of Department \(HoD\), along with several faculty members, attends the event, and a special guest invited by the HoD shares their experiences. Students are provided with a broader understanding of the department, followed by lab visits where they can explore various testing facilities. The event is a collaborative effort between the department council and the DAMP team, with strong involvement from the HoD, and is supported by PhD students and lab in-charges who help facilitate the lab tours.)
/E (This event, typically held at the start of the semester, serves to introduce freshers to key aspects of the department. The Head of Department \(HoD\), along with several faculty members, attends the event, and a special guest invited by the HoD shares their experiences. Students are provided with a broader understanding of the department, followed by lab visits where they can explore various testing facilities. The event is a collaborative effort between the department council and the DAMP team, with strong involvement from the HoD, and is supported by PhD students and lab in-charges who help facilitate the lab tours.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
