/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (This event is organized for the graduating batch, featuring the Head of Department \(HoD\), a Chief Guest, and several faculty members, who together preside over the degree distribution ceremony. The event has a formal tone, with much of the time dedicated to speeches by the HoD and Chief Guest, offering their best wishes to the graduating students for their future endeavors. Following the degree distribution, refreshments, including tea and snacks, are provided to conclude the event.)
/E (This event is organized for the graduating batch, featuring the Head of Department \(HoD\), a Chief Guest, and several faculty members, who together preside over the degree distribution ceremony. The event has a formal tone, with much of the time dedicated to speeches by the HoD and Chief Guest, offering their best wishes to the graduating students for their future endeavors. Following the degree distribution, refreshments, including tea and snacks, are provided to conclude the event.)
