<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This informal gathering, organized by the department council, aims to bring the new batch together in a fun and relaxed setting. Featuring refreshments, unique games, performances, group photos, and prize giveaways, it fosters bonding and interaction within the batch. Held on weekends after quizzes, separate events are arranged for UG and PG freshers to ensure a tailored experience, making it an evening of entertainment and connection.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
