955 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The department-wide sports event brings together UG, PG, and PhD students for friendly competition in cricket, badminton, volleyball, basketball, table tennis, and more. Teams, typically formed by batchmates, compete against juniors or seniors. Winners receive medals or trophies from the department council, which organizes venues and equipment. The event runs in two phases for smooth management, with new sports like Tug of War introduced based on student interest.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
