957 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This is the department's most anticipated event, held in the spring semester, where students and professors gather for an informal celebration. Organized by the department council, it features traditional attire, student performances, games involving students and professors, and plenty of entertainment. The evening concludes with batch photos and a council-arranged dinner, with fun brochures adding a special touch to this cherished event.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [4]
>>
