959 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This event is specifically organized for the graduating batch and is held by the department council before their official graduation. It serves as a final gathering for students to celebrate and bring a meaningful close to their journey together in the department. While the attire is formal, the event itself is filled with fun and informal activities, such as the presentation of humorous and informal awards based on different traits or achievements, as nominated by their peers. In addition to the awards, various games and performances are arranged to keep the atmosphere lively and engaging. Toward the end, each student receives a special gift from the council as a memento of their time in the department. The event typically begins with a cake-cutting ceremony and a group photo, setting the tone for an evening of celebration and memories.)
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [3]
>>
